("Fourteen fouls. The approach worked here but carries a booking and free-kick risk against stronger set-piece sides.", "Quatorze fautes. L'approche a fonctionné ici mais expose aux cartons et aux coups francs face à des équipes plus fortes sur coups de pied arrêtés.", "Madhambi kumi na manne. Mbinu ilifanya kazi hapa lakini ina hatari ya kadi na mipira ya adhabu dhidi ya timu imara zaidi kwenye mipira ya kutengwa.", "Catorze faltas. A abordagem funcionou aqui, mas traz risco de cartões e de faltas contra adversárias mais fortes na bola parada."),
("Scored two minutes after half-time and hit the crossbar in the closing stages.", "But deux minutes après la pause et une barre transversale en fin de match.", "Walifunga dakika mbili baada ya mapumziko na wakagonga mwamba wa juu dakika za mwisho.", "Gol dois minutos depois do intervalo e uma bola no travessão no fim."),
("One change all match. Japan's five substitutes brought fresher legs to the final 20 minutes.", "Un seul changement de tout le match. Les cinq remplaçantes japonaises ont apporté de la fraîcheur dans les 20 dernières minutes.", "Mabadiliko moja tu katika mechi nzima. Wachezaji watano wa akiba wa Japani walileta nguvu mpya katika dakika 20 za mwisho.", "Uma única troca no jogo todo. As cinco reservas do Japão trouxeram pernas mais frescas aos 20 minutos finais."),
("Set pieces", "Coups de pied arrêtés", "Mipira ya kutengwa", "Bola parada"),
("Conceded nothing from Japan's free kicks.", "Rien encaissé sur les coups francs japonais.", "Hawakuruhusu bao lolote kutoka mipira ya adhabu ya Japani.", "Não sofreu nada nas faltas do Japão."),
("Japan's 80' goal came from the return ball after a corner.", "Le but japonais de la 80e est venu du ballon remis après un corner.", "Bao la Japani la dakika ya 80 lilitokana na mpira uliorudishwa baada ya kona.", "O gol do Japão aos 80' saiu da bola devolvida depois de um escanteio."),
("Source: ESPN completed match record; FIFA and CAF match reports; broadcast review.", "Source : fiche de match complète d'ESPN ; comptes rendus de la FIFA et de la CAF ; revue des images.", "Chanzo: rekodi kamili ya mechi ya ESPN; ripoti za mechi za FIFA na CAF; mapitio ya matangazo.", "Fonte: súmula completa da ESPN; relatórios da FIFA e da CAF; revisão da transmissão."),
("Tournament context", "Contexte du tournoi", "Muktadha wa mashindano", "Contexto do torneio"),
("Measured against the defending champions", "Comparées aux tenantes du titre", "Wakipimwa dhidi ya mabingwa watetezi", "Comparadas com as atuais campeãs"),
("Japan reached the final unbeaten; Nigeria won six in a row after losing their opener. Both went through DPR Korea, the two-time holders.", "Le Japon a atteint la finale invaincu ; le Nigeria a gagné six fois de suite après avoir perdu son premier match. Les deux sont passés par la RPD de Corée, double tenante du titre.", "Japani walifika fainali bila kufungwa; Nigeria walishinda mechi sita mfululizo baada ya kupoteza mechi ya kwanza. Wote walipita kwa kuiondoa Korea Kaskazini, mabingwa mara mbili.", "O Japão chegou invicto à final; a Nigéria venceu seis seguidas depois de perder a estreia. As duas passaram pela Coreia do Norte, bicampeã."),
