("Japan technical staff", "Staff technique du Japon", "Benchi la ufundi la Japani", "Comissão técnica do Japão"),
("Review handling of dipping shots and cover behind the high line as two separate work items.", "Travailler séparément la prise de balle sur frappes plongeantes et la couverture derrière la ligne haute.", "Pitia upokeaji wa mashuti yanayoshuka na ulinzi nyuma ya mstari wa juu kama kazi mbili tofauti.", "Revisar a defesa de chutes caindo e a cobertura atrás da linha alta como dois trabalhos separados."),
