("Fund a structured fixture calendar to keep the title-winning group together.", "Financer un calendrier de matchs structuré pour garder le groupe championne ensemble.", "Gharimia ratiba ya mechi iliyopangwa ili kuweka pamoja kikosi kilichotwaa taji.", "Financiar um calendário de jogos estruturado para manter o grupo campeão unido."),
("5 Feb 2027", "5 févr. 2027", "5 Feb 2027", "5 de fev. de 2027"),
("Japan's strongest case", "Le meilleur argument du Japon", "Hoja kuu ya Japani", "O melhor argumento do Japão"),
("More possession, more completed passes, and a late goal from the bench. The opener came from a dipping shot their goalkeeper could not hold.", "Plus de possession, plus de passes réussies et un but tardif venu du banc. L'ouverture du score est venue d'une frappe plongeante que leur gardienne n'a pas pu maîtriser.", "Umiliki zaidi, pasi nyingi zaidi zilizofika, na bao la dakika za mwisho kutoka benchi. Bao la kwanza lilitokana na shuti linaloshuka ambalo kipa wao hakuweza kulizuia.", "Mais posse, mais passes certos e um gol no fim vindo do banco. O primeiro gol saiu de um chute caindo que a goleira não conseguiu segurar."),
("Why Nigeria deserved it", "Pourquoi le Nigeria l'a mérité", "Kwa nini Nigeria walistahili", "Por que a Nigéria mereceu"),
("More shots on target, double the conversion rate, 1.48 expected goals to 0.82, a separate well-built winner, and a late crossbar.", "Plus de tirs cadrés, deux fois plus d'efficacité, 1,48 but attendu contre 0,82, un but de la victoire bien construit et une barre transversale en fin de match.", "Mashuti zaidi yaliyolenga goli, ufanisi mara mbili, mabao yanayotarajiwa 1.48 dhidi ya 0.82, bao la ushindi lililojengwa vizuri, na kugonga mwamba wa juu dakika za mwisho.", "Mais chutes no gol, o dobro de aproveitamento, 1,48 gol esperado contra 0,82, um gol da vitória bem construído e uma bola no travessão no fim."),
("How we can support you", "Comment nous pouvons vous accompagner", "Jinsi tunavyoweza kukusaidia", "Como podemos apoiar você"),
("1. Updated report", "1. Rapport mis à jour", "1. Ripoti iliyosasishwa", "1. Relatório atualizado"),
("We refresh this analysis with FIFA's tracking and pressing data as soon as it publishes.", "Nous mettons cette analyse à jour avec les données de tracking et de pressing de la FIFA dès leur publication.", "Tunasasisha uchambuzi huu kwa takwimu za ufuatiliaji na kubana za FIFA mara tu zinapochapishwa.", "Atualizamos esta análise com os dados de rastreamento e pressão da FIFA assim que forem publicados."),
("2. Development profiles", "2. Profils de développement", "2. Wasifu wa maendeleo", "2. Perfis de desenvolvimento"),
("Player development profiles for the final's standout performers, built with the federations and families.", "Des profils de développement pour les joueuses qui se sont distinguées en finale, construits avec les fédérations et les familles.", "Wasifu wa maendeleo kwa wachezaji walioong'aa katika fainali, unaoandaliwa pamoja na mashirikisho na familia.", "Perfis de desenvolvimento das jogadoras de destaque na final, montados com as federações e as famílias."),
("3. Staff briefing", "3. Briefing du staff", "3. Mazungumzo na benchi la ufundi", "3. Briefing para a comissão"),
("A 45-minute video briefing for technical staff on the three goals and the phase read.", "Un briefing vidéo de 45 minutes pour le staff technique sur les trois buts et la lecture par phase.", "Mazungumzo ya video ya dakika 45 kwa benchi la ufundi kuhusu mabao matatu na uchambuzi wa awamu.", "Um briefing em vídeo de 45 minutos para a comissão técnica sobre os três gols e a leitura por fase."),
