("Sources and original video", "Sources et vidéo originale", "Vyanzo na video halisi", "Fontes e vídeo original"),
("What this dashboard is built on", "Sur quoi repose ce tableau de bord", "Dashibodi hii imejengwa juu ya nini", "Em que este painel se baseia"),
("Score, scorers, assists, awards and routes come from FIFA, CAF and the national federations, matched against Graphic Online, Premium Times and Fox Sports. Team and player statistics come from ESPN's completed match record. Expected goals come from FlashFootball's live model at 89:40, before Japan's final two shots.", "Score, buteuses, passes décisives, distinctions et parcours proviennent de la FIFA, de la CAF et des fédérations nationales, recoupés avec Graphic Online, Premium Times et Fox Sports. Les statistiques des équipes et des joueuses proviennent de la fiche de match complète d'ESPN. Les buts attendus proviennent du modèle en direct de FlashFootball à 89:40, avant les deux derniers tirs du Japon.", "Matokeo, wafungaji, pasi za mabao, tuzo na njia za kufika fainali zinatoka FIFA, CAF na mashirikisho ya kitaifa, zikilinganishwa na Graphic Online, Premium Times na Fox Sports. Takwimu za timu na wachezaji zinatoka kwenye rekodi kamili ya mechi ya ESPN. Mabao yanayotarajiwa yanatoka kwenye mfumo wa moja kwa moja wa FlashFootball dakika 89:40, kabla ya mashuti mawili ya mwisho ya Japani.", "Placar, autoras dos gols, assistências, prêmios e campanhas vêm da FIFA, da CAF e das federações nacionais, conferidos com Graphic Online, Premium Times e Fox Sports. As estatísticas das seleções e das jogadoras vêm da súmula completa da ESPN. Os gols esperados vêm do modelo ao vivo da FlashFootball aos 89:40, antes das duas últimas finalizações do Japão."),
("FIFA's post-match summary report adds tracking and pressing data; we update this dashboard when it publishes. Fox Sports' feed times the goals at 38' and 79'; FIFA and CAF record 39' and 80', which we use.", "Le rapport d'après-match de la FIFA ajoutera les données de tracking et de pressing ; nous mettrons ce tableau de bord à jour dès sa publication. Le flux de Fox Sports situe les buts à la 38e et à la 79e ; la FIFA et la CAF retiennent la 39e et la 80e, que nous utilisons.", "Ripoti ya FIFA ya baada ya mechi inaongeza takwimu za ufuatiliaji na kubana; tunasasisha dashibodi hii itakapochapishwa. Matangazo ya Fox Sports yanaonyesha mabao dakika ya 38 na 79; FIFA na CAF zinarekodi dakika ya 39 na 80, ambazo tunazitumia.", "O relatório pós-jogo da FIFA acrescenta dados de rastreamento e pressão; atualizamos este painel quando ele for publicado. O feed da Fox Sports marca os gols aos 38' e 79'; FIFA e CAF registram 39' e 80', que usamos."),
