("Mary Dunstan finds Awawu Bashiru, whose dropping effort dips late and squeezes past Kou Kadowaki. Bashiru's third goal in two matches.", "Mary Dunstan trouve Awawu Bashiru, dont la frappe plonge tard et passe sous Kou Kadowaki. Troisième but de Bashiru en deux matchs.", "Mary Dunstan anampata Awawu Bashiru, ambaye shuti lake linashuka ghafla na kumpita Kou Kadowaki. Bao la tatu la Bashiru katika mechi mbili.", "Mary Dunstan encontra Awawu Bashiru, cujo chute cai no fim e passa por Kou Kadowaki. Terceiro gol de Bashiru em dois jogos."),
("Coaching focus for Japan: set position and handling against dipping shots.", "Axe de travail pour le Japon : placement et prise de balle face aux frappes plongeantes.", "Kipaumbele cha mafunzo kwa Japani: msimamo wa kipa na upokeaji dhidi ya mashuti yanayoshuka.", "Foco de treino para o Japão: posicionamento e defesa contra chutes que caem."),
("Esther Stephen plays over Japan's last line. Oluebube Umejiaku attacks the space, controls with her left foot and lobs Kadowaki. The winner, two minutes after the restart.", "Esther Stephen passe par-dessus la dernière ligne japonaise. Oluebube Umejiaku attaque l'espace, contrôle du gauche et lobe Kadowaki. Le but de la victoire, deux minutes après la reprise.", "Esther Stephen anapiga mpira juu ya mstari wa mwisho wa Japani. Oluebube Umejiaku anashambulia nafasi, anaumiliki kwa mguu wa kushoto na kumpandisha Kadowaki. Bao la ushindi, dakika mbili baada ya mapumziko.", "Esther Stephen lança por cima da última linha japonesa. Oluebube Umejiaku ataca o espaço, domina com a esquerda e encobre Kadowaki. O gol da vitória, dois minutos depois do reinício."),
("The space behind Japan's high line decided the final. Pressure on the passer and cover behind the line are Japan's two work items.", "L'espace dans le dos de la ligne haute japonaise a décidé la finale. La pression sur la passeuse et la couverture derrière la ligne sont les deux chantiers du Japon.", "Nafasi nyuma ya mstari wa juu wa Japani iliamua fainali. Kumbana mpigaji pasi na ulinzi nyuma ya mstari ni kazi mbili za Japani.", "O espaço nas costas da linha alta japonesa decidiu a final. Pressão sobre quem passa e cobertura atrás da linha são os dois trabalhos do Japão."),
("Substitute Anri Ito heads a corner back across goal and Fuki Ito volleys the second ball in.", "Entrée en jeu, Anri Ito remet de la tête un corner devant le but et Fuki Ito reprend de volée le second ballon.", "Mchezaji wa akiba Anri Ito anapiga kichwa mpira wa kona kurudisha mbele ya goli na Fuki Ito anafunga mpira wa pili kwa volley.", "A reserva Anri Ito cabeceia um escanteio de volta para a área e Fuki Ito finaliza o rebote de primeira."),
("Nigeria's work item: second-ball marking at defensive corners. Japan's 63' changes produced a direct goal involvement.", "Chantier pour le Nigeria : le marquage du second ballon sur corners défensifs. Les changements japonais de la 63e ont directement pesé sur un but.", "Kazi ya Nigeria: ulinzi wa mpira wa pili kwenye kona za kujihami. Mabadiliko ya Japani ya dakika ya 63 yalichangia bao moja kwa moja.", "Trabalho para a Nigéria: marcação do rebote nos escanteios defensivos. As trocas do Japão aos 63' participaram diretamente de um gol."),
("Saves", "Arrêts", "Kuokoa", "Defesas"),
("Shots on target faced", "Tirs cadrés subis", "Mashuti yaliyolenga goli aliyokabili", "Chutes no gol sofridos"),
("Goals conceded", "Buts encaissés", "Mabao ya kufungwa", "Gols sofridos"),
("Clean catches or blocks", "Prises de balle ou blocages propres", "Kudaka au kuzuia kwa usafi", "Defesas seguras ou bloqueios"),
("Each made one save. Kadowaki saved a penalty in the semi-final shootout, and Japan kept four clean sheets in the tournament. Both deserve tracking across full seasons.", "Chacune a réalisé un arrêt. Kadowaki a arrêté un penalty lors de la séance de tirs au but en demi-finale, et le Japon n'a pas encaissé de but à quatre reprises dans le tournoi. Toutes deux méritent un suivi sur des saisons complètes.", "Kila mmoja aliokoa mara moja. Kadowaki aliokoa penalti katika mikwaju ya nusu fainali, na Japani hawakufungwa katika mechi nne za mashindano. Wote wawili wanastahili kufuatiliwa kwa misimu mizima.", "Cada uma fez uma defesa. Kadowaki defendeu um pênalti na disputa da semifinal, e o Japão não sofreu gols em quatro jogos do torneio. As duas merecem acompanhamento por temporadas inteiras."),
